{"Backup code verification only strips dashes and is case-sensitive; generated codes are lowercase hex while the UI suggests uppercase, causing users pasting uppercase codes or codes with whitespace to be incorrectly rejected": 0.9025058746337891, "EnableTwoFactorModal creates a Blob URL for downloading backup codes but doesn't revoke it on close/reset/unmount, leaving a live URL and retaining memory with sensitive content longer than necessary": 0.7711318135261536, "Login form disables browser validation (noValidate) and the schema doesn't require backupCode; submitting the backup-code screen empty can re-set twoFactorRequired without showing a useful error, leaving users stuck": 0.6541112661361694, "Backup-code related i18n keys were added to en/common.json only; other locales will display raw keys until translated": 0.440051406621933}